# onchain-verbs.list — on-chain verbs by recoverability (contract §1.2, spec §3).
#
# Columns: class cluster argv...
#   class:   irreversible (Class U: destroys the capability even for its owner) |
#            recoverable (Class C: moves value or capability to a counterparty)
#   cluster: any (decide whatever the cluster) | net (the decision depends on the cluster)
#   argv:    tokens after wrapper normalisation. Literal tokens and * (exactly one token)
#            match in order from the program name; [--flag] = that flag present anywhere
#            after the verb. A row matches a command that starts with its tokens.
# irreversible net: deny on mainnet or any cluster not positively identified as
# localnet/devnet (testnet and Unknown included), ask on identified localnet/devnet; never
# relaxed by grant, tier, repo or env. A consumer without a cluster resolver denies.
# irreversible any: default-wallet destruction (solana-keygen new|recover with --force and
# no -o, or -o naming the default wallet / CLI keypair_path): deny on every cluster.
# recoverable net: plugin semantics (caps, grants, mainnet/Unknown ask, High deny).
# solana program close <program-id> is irreversible; closing a buffer is recoverable (the
# plugin tells them apart). Records are sorted (LC_ALL=C) and unique.
#
# Union of the kit's DENY_IRREVERSIBLE_ONCHAIN capability-destroying shapes (firewall.sh at
# kit commit 42755ab, last changed in 0ffd72b, rule set 7) and the safe-ai-skill set. The
# kit's counterparty entries (solana transfer|close|authorize|withdraw-from-nonce-account)
# are recoverable, not Class U.

irreversible any solana-keygen new [--force]
irreversible any solana-keygen new [-f]
irreversible any solana-keygen recover [--force]
irreversible any solana-keygen recover [-f]
irreversible net anchor deploy [--final]
irreversible net anchor idl close
irreversible net anchor idl erase-authority
irreversible net anchor program deploy [--final]
irreversible net anchor program set-upgrade-authority [--final]
irreversible net anchor program upgrade [--final]
irreversible net anchor program write-buffer [--final]
irreversible net solana close-vote-account
irreversible net solana program close [--bypass-warning]
irreversible net solana program deploy [--final]
irreversible net solana program set-upgrade-authority [--final]
irreversible net solana program upgrade [--final]
irreversible net solana program write-buffer [--final]
irreversible net solana program-v4 * [--final]
irreversible net solana program-v4 finalize
irreversible net spl-token authorize [--disable]
irreversible net spl-token burn
irreversible net spl-token close
irreversible net spl-token close-mint
recoverable net anchor deploy
recoverable net anchor idl set-authority
recoverable net anchor program deploy
recoverable net anchor program upgrade
recoverable net anchor program write-buffer
recoverable net anchor upgrade
recoverable net solana program close
recoverable net solana program deploy
recoverable net solana program extend
recoverable net solana program set-upgrade-authority
recoverable net solana program upgrade
recoverable net solana program write-buffer
recoverable net solana program-v4 deploy
recoverable net solana transfer
recoverable net solana withdraw-from-nonce-account
recoverable net solana withdraw-from-vote-account
recoverable net solana withdraw-stake
recoverable net spl-token authorize
recoverable net spl-token gc
recoverable net spl-token transfer
